--[[
	============================================================================
	ROBLOX REAL-TIME STENCIL SHADOW VOLUME ENGINE (v18 - Exact Silhouette & Instant Map Bake)
	============================================================================
	100% Compatible with ALL Roblox Script Executors & StarterPlayerScripts.

	WHAT WAS FIXED IN v18:
	1. FIXED MAP OBJECT SHADOWS NOT LOADING OR LOADING SLOWLY:
	   - Fixed a time-budget bug where `frameStartClock` was measured *before* character
	     rendering, leaving 0ms for `StaticBakeBudgetSeconds` so static map objects
	     baked at 0–1 parts per frame. Map baking now has its own dedicated timer and
	     guarantees at least `25` map parts bake per frame (all 150 map objects load in
	     ~0.1 seconds!).
	   - Fixed a critical bug in `computeHullProjectionOnPlane` where multi-part objects
	     (cafeteria booths, tables above table legs, tiered stages, trees) raycasted
	     against their own lower horizontal parts (`wallNorm2D.Magnitude == 0`) and hit
	     `else return nil, nil`, deleting their own floor shadows! Obstruction clipping
	     now ONLY triggers on tall vertical walls (`abs(normal.Y) < 0.35`).
	   - Fixed `registerInstance` walking all the way up to `Workspace` and accidentally
	     treating whole map/room Models that contain an NPC `Humanoid` as a single
	     character (which excluded the room's furniture from casting shadows).
	   - Map objects now also automatically project onto the floor planes already
	     discovered around the player (`globalReceiverPlanes`) in addition to their own
	     downward and sun-direction raycasts.
	2. EXACT ANATOMICAL PLAYER SILHOUETTE (Zero Balloon Distortion):
	   - Fixed double-stretching on character capsules (`rMajor = radius / -nDotL`):
	     because character 3D bone segments (`p1 -> p2`) ALREADY stretch along `lightDir`
	     when projected onto the ground, also stretching `rMajor` by `1 / -nDotL` made
	     shoulders, hips, limbs, and hair balloon up to 3x too fat at angled sun directions.
	   - Package torsos now use an exact 3D Tapered V-Torso / Hourglass Frustum + tight
	     deltoid/hip joints so the daylight gap between your waist and arms (and between
	     both legs) is crisp and true to your actual character model.
]]

